            "mode": "learn",
            "concept": "To add functions, add their outputs. (f + g)(x) = f(x) + g(x). Evaluate each function, then add the results. <div class=\"example-box\"><div class=\"example-label\">Example: f(x) = 2x, g(x) = x + 3</div><div class=\"example-item\">(f + g)(x) = 2x + (x + 3)</div><div class=\"example-item\">= <span class=\"highlight\">3x + 3</span></div></div>",
